<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound o/n and weekly rates rise.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound o/n and weekly rates rise.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight rates on the Egyptian pound rose in a short start-of-the-week private sector market on Sunday to between 8-3/4 and 9-5/8 percent from 8 and 8-3/4 percent on Thursday, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates also rose to range from nine to 9-1/2 percent compared to 8-1/4 and 9-1/4 on Thursday.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
